        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The plans below show the site of a farm in 1950 and the same site today. </strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and </strong><strong>make</strong><strong> comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></span></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Farm Site: 1950 vs Today</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Farm Site: 1950 vs Today y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về sự thay đổi của Trang trại Beechwood từ năm 1950 đến ng&agrave;y nay.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Farm Site: 1950 vs Today với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: sự thay đổi của Trang trại Beechwood - từ năm 1950 đến ng&agrave;y nay.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CdvqdqsCwoZpISxeqMFlbClCg8d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FiQHdEDwpoGI4Dxc57zlU2NGg3e\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DxT6dPFe5oRe6Sxp2vbl7gmzg5e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>khu vực n&agrave;y đ&atilde; trải qua sự ph&aacute;t triển đ&aacute;ng kể, từ <strong>một hoạt động n&ocirc;ng nghiệp truyền thống</strong><em><strong> </strong></em><em>(a traditional agricultural operation)</em> chuyển th&agrave;nh một trang trại đa dạng h&oacute;a kết hợp n&ocirc;ng nghiệp với c&aacute;c cơ sở vật chất về du lịch v&agrave; giải tr&iacute; <em>(tourism and recreational facilities)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRB0dBuuZoH0mbxyPXBlltAig1b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>trong khi <strong>c&aacute;c khu vực canh t&aacute;c cốt l&otilde;i</strong><em> (core farming areas)</em> đ&atilde; được giữ lại, nhiều tiện nghi hiện đại đ&atilde; được bổ sung để <strong>phục vụ du kh&aacute;ch</strong> <em>(accomodate visitors)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KTxKddf8JoRwYSx7VCNl8FJ3gCb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c khu vực n&ocirc;ng nghiệp vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n phần lớn </strong><em>(remain largely intact)</em></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iz7udY6hkoopNzxDyW9lDQlVgId\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QsJedFD72ox0RHxA4hblkrwQgyb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&aacute;c khu canh t&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m bao gồm c&acirc;y ăn quả, c&acirc;y c&oacute; m&uacute;i v&agrave; rau củ đ&atilde; <strong>giữ vị tr&iacute; ban đầu&nbsp;</strong><em>(maintain their original positions)</em>&nbsp;ở ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y của khu vực</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ALC0dnaw5oeG21xxQjRlL3UCg4g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>nh&agrave; n&ocirc;ng trại, chuồng gia s&uacute;c v&agrave; khu vực nu&ocirc;i g&agrave; cũng <strong>giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; </strong><em>(retain their locations)</em>&nbsp;ở phần đ&ocirc;ng nam, mặc d&ugrave; chuồng gia s&uacute;c c&oacute; vẻ đ&atilde; được di chuyển gần nh&agrave; n&ocirc;ng trại hơn một ch&uacute;t</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MbM2dVmtzoiMLUxNVhyl0PZhgvf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&aacute;c con s&ocirc;ng tiếp tục <strong>chảy theo c&ugrave;ng lộ tr&igrave;nh&nbsp;</strong><em>(follow the same paths)</em>, <strong>tạo th&agrave;nh ranh giới tự nhi&ecirc;n cho khu đất&nbsp;</strong><em>(provide natural boundaries for the property)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\"><br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FxBNdzR1roJES4xD9wxljxCCgfd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: C&aacute;c ph&aacute;t triển mới hướng đến du lịch </strong><em>(tourism-oriented developments)</em></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AtxOdLiIGoAW2NxuBbSljxFpgtb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L3v9d2PdCohnsJxIcYqli2iygqc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>sự ph&aacute;t triển nổi bật nhất l&agrave; việc đưa v&agrave;o một khu cắm trại ở khu vực đ&ocirc;ng bắc, với lều trại v&agrave; c&acirc;y xanh, nơi trước đ&acirc;y l&agrave; <strong>khu chăn thả cừu</strong> <em>(a sheep grazing)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GMaidjRdGorLl2xqyT1lzRHcgqc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>c&aacute;c ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; nghỉ dưỡng</strong> <em>(holiday cottages) </em>đ&atilde; được x&acirc;y dựng liền kề với nh&agrave; n&ocirc;ng trại v&agrave; chuồng gia s&uacute;c, tạo ra c&aacute;c <strong>cơ sở lưu tr&uacute; cho du kh&aacute;ch </strong><em>(create accomodation facilities for visitors)</em><strong>.</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxGVdUMoXoyyz0x89ZylqWe8g6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">trang trại cũng bổ sung cơ sở hạ tầng hiện đại bao gồm c&aacute;c tấm pin mặt trời ở phần ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng, một cửa h&agrave;ng trang trại gần <strong>ng&atilde; tư đường </strong><em>(road intersection)</em>, v&agrave; hai khu vực đỗ xe được chỉ định - một khu gần khu cắm trại v&agrave; một khu kh&aacute;c gần c&aacute;c ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; nghỉ dưỡng để <strong>tạo thuận lợi cho việc tiếp cận của du kh&aacute;ch </strong><em>(facilitate tourist access)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1700,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z0u1dVxZto1yZLxK6ZIlohnFgCc\">The maps illustrate the transformation of Beechwood Farm from 1950 to the present day.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18299,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1701,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RtRTdHERYo3rMixdMgMlXySJgSx\">Overall, the site has undergone significant development, evolving from a traditional agricultural operation into a diversified farm that combines agriculture with tourism and recreational facilities. While the core farming areas have been preserved, numerous modern amenities have been added to accommodate visitors.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18299,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1702,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KZ82dADCXoRz1FxvpDzla61agFb\">Regarding the agricultural sections that remained largely intact, the central farming areas, including fruit trees, soft fruits, and vegetables, maintained their original positions in the western part of the site. The farmhouse, barn, and chicken area also retained their locations in the southeastern section, though the barn appears to have been relocated slightly closer to the farmhouse. Additionally, the rivers continued to flow along the same paths, providing natural boundaries for the property.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18299,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1703,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MySTdaRVkoMDIJx8p7Rlgm9LgFb\">As for the new tourism-oriented developments, the most striking addition was the introduction of a camping field in the northeastern area, complete with tents and trees, where sheep grazing had previously taken place. Furthermore, holiday cottages were constructed adjacent to the farmhouse and barn, creating accommodation facilities for visitors. The farm also added modern infrastructure including solar panels in the eastern section, a farm shop near the road intersection, and two designated parking areas - one near the camping field and another close to the holiday cottages to facilitate tourist access.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18299,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
